  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI have completed the translations for both Japanese and Korean versions of the HTML specification. Please add the following links to the [Translations page on the wiki](https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/Translations).\r\n\r\n- **Japanese translation**: [Link to the Japanese version] (https://jp.htmlspecs.com/)\r\n- **Korean translation**: [Link to the Korean version] (https://ko.htmlspecs.com/)\r\n\r\nThank you for your assistance!\r\n\r\n\r\n",
